ی","overview":"","popularity":3.3946,"poster_path":"/m1YDiPSENTVMaxvbbmjdV8julwS.jpg","release_date":"2007-05-21","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.0,"vote_count":1,"credit_id":"5e08f493a1c59d0018aabbf7","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/hU8Jdzad0DoMRzjPDb2ZJXTepXg.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":659134,"title":"فرش ایرانی","original_language":"fa","original_title":"فرش ایرانی","overview":"","popularity":3.3946,"poster_path":"/m1YDiPSENTVMaxvbbmjdV8julwS.jpg","release_date":"2007-05-21","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.0,"vote_count":1,"credit_id":"5e287e6f9638640011aa79bd","department":"Writing","job":"Screenplay"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":718607,"title":"Celles qui chantent","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Celles qui chantent","overview":"","popularity":0.8867,"poster_path":"/yuaZ1W3xuwbLBF096lsH4YciPSU.jpg","release_date":"2020-07-08","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.1,"vote_count":4,"credit_id":"5ef9cb8abe7f350034a07843","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/47NmEf7kEmsNK3T9hiquNYO8fU9.jpg","genre_ids":[35,18],"id":13209,"title":"Na spalonym","original_language":"fa","original_title":"آفساید","overview":"W Iranie kobiety nie mają prawa wchodzić na stadion na mecze piłki nożnej. Tłem dla filmu jest mecz, który Iran rozegrał z Bahrajnem w eliminacjach do Mistrzostw Azji 2006. Sześć zwariowanych na punkcie futbolu młodych irańskich kobiet chce go obejrzeć na żywo. Tak jak mężczyźni, dziewczyny te chcą jedynie uczestniczyć w szalonej, wspólnej chwili poparcia własnego kraju i uhonorowania umiejętności piłkarzy. Aby spełnić te pragnienia, kobiety muszą udawać mężczyzn i mieć nadzieję na to, że strażnicy pilnujący stadionów nie zorientują się.  Film nie porusza jedynie tematu kobiet wykluczonych z oglądania meczów - chodzi w ogóle o ich prawa w społeczeństwie muzułmańskim. Kiedy kobiety zbliżają się do stadionu i widzą skrawek magicznego trawiastego dywanu boiska, irańskie społeczeństwo i jego sprzeczności ukazują się jak na dłoni.","popularity":2.2872,"poster_path":"/oVLZG2Q412d52w4mqqszCrANMDU.jpg","release_date":"2006-05-26","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.0,"vote_count":138,"credit_id":"5f2d8b8daf58cb0035b3123b","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/AvfyW1Rzp6zAE39yXft7DJVAiSE.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":742958,"title":"Hidden","original_language":"fa","original_title":"Hidden","overview":"","popularity":0.6264,"poster_path":"/wg58ZoIX1bO7MzINRrjS4k6JSDD.jpg","release_date":"2020-09-21","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.5,"vote_count":25,"credit_id":"5f6003d83123450039653f16","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/21smz3enIhXXwn6GKq7stSQCWrV.jpg","genre_ids":[80,18,10749],"id":384587,"title":"حکم","original_language":"fa","original_title":"حکم","overview":"","popularity":0.5647,"poster_path":"/rMxUv7miRKveEwOpt9PVBb43nt8.jpg","release_date":"2005-12-05","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":4.333,"vote_count":6,"credit_id":"5fca8adeb0040a004227c3bc","department":"Editing","job":"Editor"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/AvfyW1Rzp6zAE39yXft7DJVAiSE.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":742958,"title":"Hidden","original_language":"fa","original_title":"Hidden","overview":"","popularity":0.6264,"poster_path":"/wg58ZoIX1bO7MzINRrjS4k6JSDD.jpg","release_date":"2020-09-21","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.5,"vote_count":25,"credit_id":"603fd7001065d30042ba24ba","department":"Camera","job":"Director of Photography"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/cYXDmauz29YMVSeOg3QTh5LsclB.jpg","genre_ids":[18],"id":43768,"title":"کافه ترانزیت","original_language":"fa","original_title":"کافه ترانزیت","overview":"","popularity":0.7308,"poster_path":"/ApR2Yf5tixtCf10lCh1Tjua1Pjg.jpg","release_date":"2005-11-03","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.7,"vote_count":9,"credit_id":"60355c61ac8e6b0055680182","department":"Editing","job":"Editor"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/guzBItSjW1nPktU9LB8SAARGEzA.jpg","genre_ids":[18],"id":13898,"title":"دایره","original_language":"fa","original_title":"دایره","overview":"","popularity":1.2134,"poster_path":"/fhZfpKRYMq9bXrH4iKrCYTXpSHc.jpg","release_date":"2000-09-09","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.976,"vote_count":103,"credit_id":"60462f7ca410c8006e886784","department":"Writing","job":"Idea"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/jRLhcuyTPgcaCzrTKVTVrFDWrYo.jpg","genre_ids":[18,10751],"id":46785,"title":"بادکنک سفید","original_language":"fa","original_title":"بادکنک سفید","overview":"","popularity":1.5054,"poster_path":"/Ata1d5ef5KGiUP8bWkJQ5ZSEpNN.jpg","release_date":"1995-01-02","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.5,"vote_count":122,"credit_id":"6745b9f2c24765fa2f2e0d88","department":"Writing","job":"Story"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/zhoMwQofjgVec5Sin05hWECJtVQ.jpg","genre_ids":[18,53,80,9648],"id":1456349,"title":"To był zwykły przypadek","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Un simple accident","overview":"Nocny kierowca Eghbal, jadąc z ciężarną żoną, zabija psa. Utknąwszy, szuka pomocy w garażu Vahida, nieświadomy, że jego wybawca uważa go za strażnika więziennego, który go torturował. Przekonany Vahid porywa Eghbala, aby go żywcem zakopać, ale wkrótce pojawiają się wątpliwości. Aby potwierdzić tożsamość Eghbala, Vahid werbuje inne ofiary. Podczas podróży rozważają moralność zabicia ich jeńca i czy faktycznie jest tym, za kogo go uważają.","popularity":7.5604,"poster_path":"/ApUDHeds9UilD82f0irFo6Puiee.jpg","release_date":"2025-10-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.156,"vote_count":629,"credit_id":"67e889a4e3e5257ac5cb2678","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/zhoMwQofjgVec5Sin05hWECJtVQ.jpg","genre_ids":[18,53,80,9648],"id":1456349,"title":"To był zwykły przypadek","original_language":"f